    {
      "id": "c",
      "label": "C: pricing",
      "role": "service",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 86
    },
    {
      "id": "db",
      "label": "Database",
      "role": "database",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 62
    }
  ],
  "meters": [
    { "id": "orph", "label": "Holds on a request nobody waits for", "max": 32, "warnAt": 8 },
    { "id": "left", "label": "Time budget left (ms)", "max": 2000, "start": 2000, "warnAt": 100, "good": "high" }
  ],
  "frames": [
    {
      "narration": "t=0. A user request enters A and fans down A, B, C to the database. The user will give up after 2 s. Every hop uses the same 5 s timeout.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "user",
          "to": "a",
          "label": "GET"
        },
        {
          "from": "a",
          "to": "b",
          "label": "call"
        },
        {
          "from": "b",
          "to": "c",
          "label": "call"
        },
        {
          "from": "c",
          "to": "db",
          "label": "query"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "user": "patience 2 s",
        "a": "waits up to 5 s",
        "b": "waits up to 5 s",
        "c": "waits up to 5 s"
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": "The query is slow and needs 4 s. At t=2 s the user leaves, but nothing tells A, B, C or the database. All four keep holding a thread or connection.",
      "meters": { "orph": 4 },
      "states": {
        "user": "left at 2 s",
        "a": "still waiting",
        "b": "still waiting",
        "c": "still waiting",
        "db": "query running"
      },
      "highlight": [
        "db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "At t=4 s the database answers and the result climbs back to A, where nobody is listening. That is 4 holds for 4 s each: 16 thread-seconds spent on an answer no one reads.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "db",
          "to": "c",
          "label": "rows"
        },
        {
          "from": "c",
          "to": "b",
          "label": "result"
        },
        {
          "from": "b",
          "to": "a",
          "label": "result"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "user": "gone",
        "a": "wasted 4 s",
        "b": "wasted 4 s",
        "c": "wasted 4 s",
        "db": "wasted 4 s"
      },
      "highlight": [
        "a",
        "b",
        "c",
        "db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "At 20 requests/s with 10% slow, about 8 slow requests are always in flight (Little's law: 2/s x 4 s). That is 32 holds across the four components, so pools fill and healthy requests start to queue.",
      "meters": { "orph": 32 },
      "states": {
        "c": "pools filling: 32 holds",
        "a": "queueing",
        "b": "queueing"
      },
      "highlight": [
        "c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Fix 1: nest the timeouts, shortest inside. A waits 1.8 s on B, B 1.2 s on C, C only 0.4 s per database attempt. C gives up at 0.4 s, waits 25 ms and retries; the retry takes 50 ms. Total 0.475 s.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "c",
          "to": "db",
          "label": "attempt 1"
        },
        {
          "from": "c",
          "to": "db",
          "label": "retry, 50 ms"
        },
        {
          "from": "db",
          "to": "c",
          "label": "ok"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "a": "1.8 s",
        "b": "1.2 s",
        "c": "0.4 s x 2 fits",
        "db": "attempt 1 still runs"
      },
      "highlight": [
        "c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Fix 2: A stamps an absolute deadline, t0 + 2000 ms, and passes it down (gRPC sends the remaining time in the grpc-timeout header). Every hop can compute how much budget is left.",
      "meters": { "left": 1970 },
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "a",
          "to": "b",
          "label": "left 1990 ms"
        },
        {
          "from": "b",
          "to": "c",
          "label": "left 1980 ms"
        },
        {
          "from": "c",
          "to": "db",
          "label": "left 1970 ms"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "a": "deadline t0+2000",
        "b": "budget 1980 ms",
        "c": "budget 1970 ms"
      },
      "highlight": [
        "a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "C waits min(0.4 s, budget left) per attempt. Attempt 1 times out at 0.4 s and 1.57 s remain, so C cancels it and retries. Cancelling frees the database now instead of 4 s later: 0 orphaned calls.",
      "meters": { "orph": 0, "left": 1570 },
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "c",
          "to": "db",
          "label": "cancel 1"
        },
        {
          "from": "c",
          "to": "db",
          "label": "retry"
        },
        {
          "from": "db",
          "to": "c",
          "label": "ok"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "c": "left 1.57 s: retry",
        "db": "attempt 1 cancelled"
      },
      "highlight": [
        "db"
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Now B burns 1.95 s on its own work (a cold cache). C sees 30 ms left, less than a database call needs, so it fails fast without touching the database, and A returns a degraded answer at t=2 s.",
      "meters": { "left": 30 },
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "c",
          "to": "b",
          "label": "no budget"
        },
        {
          "from": "b",
          "to": "a",
          "label": "fail fast"
        },
        {
          "from": "a",
          "to": "user",
          "label": "degraded"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "b": "spent 1.95 s",
        "c": "30 ms left: skip",
        "db": "never called",
        "user": "answered at 2 s"
      },
      "highlight": [
        "c"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
